Record that a reviewer looked at a surviving mutant

Usage: mjutest accept [OPTIONS] --reason <REASON> <MUTANT>

Arguments:
  <MUTANT>  The mutant, by identity or by any prefix that names exactly one

Options:
      --reason <REASON>  Why it may survive. Required: an acceptance without one is a mutant nobody
                         looked at
      --owner <OWNER>    Who decided
      --ticket <TICKET>  Where the decision is recorded
      --expires <WHEN>   When to look again, as RFC3339. An acceptance with none never lapses
      --run <RUN>        The run that measured it. The latest by default
  -h, --help             Print help
